  description "
    Plan section 7: the no-fork execution mode -- the wrapper re-processes test 6's fork-shape leaf
    of Light_Locale_Test with parallel_proofs = 0.
  "
  options [parallel_proofs = 0]
  sessions Light_Locale_Test
  theories
    Serial_Wrapper

